Subject: [PATCH] noise: one profile seed for every noise surface

base::apostate::ProfileNoiseBits(domain) gives 64 bits derived from the
profile id and a domain name, the same in every process and on every
launch of one profile. It is zero unless --fingerprint-noise is on and
the profile has an id, so host mode and launches without the switch stay
stock. The font, audio and canvas patches that follow draw from it.

diff --git a/base/BUILD.gn b/base/BUILD.gn
index 9196368..2a8ef85 100644
--- a/base/BUILD.gn
+++ b/base/BUILD.gn
@@ -1717,6 +1717,8 @@ component("base") {
     "apostate/media_devices.h",
     "apostate/profile.cc",
     "apostate/profile.h",
+    "apostate/profile_noise.cc",
+    "apostate/profile_noise.h",
     "system/sys_info.cc",
